{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_7000_place", "source_sha256": "bcdff45eb2d54a5d302893a8b7c5d69c8063127935f870b8c1d982067182823d", "ja": "とある森の中", "zh": "某片森林中", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_7001_p", "source_sha256": "9cde2e25ef5ded277115dc9f0779033980885a14ec70d042c8d390cc3f92e957", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影で、亜利沙は\n『スライムの攻撃姿』に挑むことになったが……）", "zh": "（在写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄中，亚利沙要挑战“史莱姆的攻击姿势”，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_7002_028ari", "source_sha256": "422f949336762a094a8ef387b2026853e2cb2d628f551920498363b09ab7ce98", "ja": "ううっ、難しいです～！\nスライムらしさと迫力、そしてかっこよさ……。", "zh": "呜呜，好难啊～！\n既要有史莱姆的感觉，又要有魄力，还要帅气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_7003_028ari", "source_sha256": "81c920a8f8928d2b5d1fb4faaed7d5b23b1d5840e026b111fb09210dc9255463", "ja": "全部を兼ね備えたスライムなんて、まさに、\n完全無欠のアイドルちゃんじゃないですか～！？", "zh": "兼具所有这些特质的史莱姆，简直就是完美无缺的偶像嘛～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_7004_p", "source_sha256": "fa268ba1ed854ef40a2addfe9296c9626e925253aa16474b6ae0af998b9286ab", "ja": "亜利沙……とりあえず落ち着こう。\nどうすればいいか、一緒に考えるから。", "zh": "亚利沙……总之先冷静一下。\n我会和你一起想想该怎么办。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_7005_p", "source_sha256": "3ec292aea1ff484995e886d643353f1b1a4bc6e7603e69f5608ce989a351a408", "ja": "スライムの攻撃と言われて、戸惑う気持ちはわかる。\n一旦、亜利沙が好きなものに置き換えてみたらどうだ？", "zh": "被说成是史莱姆的攻击，感到不知所措也是可以理解的。\n要不先换成亚利沙喜欢的东西试试看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_7006_028ari", "source_sha256": "7d900246852ce6b95369da2ccac41c8b69253503d17459f9ce6d7808fdf912d8", "ja": "は、はい。こういう時こそ落ち着いて……はっ！\n好きなものにって、もしかして！？", "zh": "是、是的。正是这种时候更要冷静……啊！\n说到喜欢的东西，难道是！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_7007", "source_sha256": "303f8bd25bed9860db6b7de31ef30d4365503543d6eedebe378d0b67b5ed749c", "ja": "知識を武器に！", "zh": "以知识为武器！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_7008", "source_sha256": "7fa23082fbaaf9d4c4bd3b1bad333f2782cc471cc37189bf1a64772508c4a75e", "ja": "体力でねじ伏せる！", "zh": "用体力压制！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_7200_p", "source_sha256": "e7605fcf273e6ce47467e95f4ad7e046ac85cd46336a9b8e31a4601cea27a35c", "ja": "そうだ。亜利沙の豊富な知識を活かす時だ！\nさっきのアイドルに例えたのは、絶妙だったしな。", "zh": "对了。正是发挥亚利沙丰富知识的时候！\n刚才用偶像来打的比方就很绝妙嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_7201_028ari", "source_sha256": "ef8d3052ca4af572af5c53242f6e12e469f154c8b9f3a600dc1bd0fa8a766986", "ja": "えへへ。アイドルちゃんのことならお任せください！\nピッタリなアイドルちゃんは……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，要说到偶像，就交给我吧！\n最合适的偶像是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_7202_028ari", "source_sha256": "b69b0480776b33c86fc9aad18f95de3c488069860904fc903107dea07ddcff20", "ja": "むむっ、閃きました！　構図もポーズもバッチリ。\n攻撃方法も問題ありません。やってみせますよ～！", "zh": "唔唔，我想到了！构图和姿势都很完美。\n攻击方式也没问题。就看我的表现吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_7300_p", "source_sha256": "e7605fcf273e6ce47467e95f4ad7e046ac85cd46336a9b8e31a4601cea27a35c", "ja": "そうだ。亜利沙の豊富な知識を活かす時だ！\nさっきのアイドルに例えたのは、絶妙だったしな。", "zh": "对了。正是发挥亚利沙丰富知识的时候！\n刚才用偶像来打的比方就很绝妙嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_7301_028ari", "source_sha256": "ab3b8f3bc13bb55455cd027a1381538fc2fe85d019f85cc6a406fed6706c971a", "ja": "ですよね！　でも……う～ん。スライムが\nアイドルちゃん、アイドルちゃんがスライム……。", "zh": "就是嘛！不过……唔～。史莱姆是偶像，偶像是史莱姆……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_7302_028ari", "source_sha256": "d3a02428811cc3c9cab15480117a0056126b16d7aadb7a12985b1f853781562c", "ja": "アイドルちゃんの衣装を着たスライム……あれ？\nありさ、こんがらがってきちゃいました～っ！？", "zh": "穿着偶像服装的史莱姆……咦？\n阿利沙的脑子都要糊涂啦～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_7500_p", "source_sha256": "3c3f90a845fe1bad45d7cf919cd127de83a02ad801660c8d701a594c0469f915", "ja": "亜利沙とスライムの共通点……。体力は少ないが、\n捨て身の覚悟で限界に挑む姿とかかな。", "zh": "亚利沙和史莱姆的共同点……大概是虽然体力不多，\n却抱持着舍身觉悟挑战极限的英姿吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_7501_028ari", "source_sha256": "e299c5c928dbe44f91ca55bd1e61a6e9bf6d28dff3ea4787cdc441662646b152", "ja": "な、なるほど？　{$P$}さんには\nありさがそう見えてるんですね。", "zh": "原、原来如此？在{$P$}先生眼里，亚利沙是这个样子啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_7502_028ari", "source_sha256": "cca990f99716147b266cc7b8df4d5536644afc7be456e781943d775f682112cd", "ja": "体力に自信はありませんが、覚悟だけは負けません！\nありさ、ここで限界を超えてみせます～っ！", "zh": "虽然我对体力没什么自信，但觉悟绝不会输给任何人！\n亚利沙要在这里突破极限给你看～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_7600_p", "source_sha256": "3c3f90a845fe1bad45d7cf919cd127de83a02ad801660c8d701a594c0469f915", "ja": "亜利沙とスライムの共通点……。体力は少ないが、\n捨て身の覚悟で限界に挑む姿とかかな。", "zh": "亚利沙和史莱姆的共同点……大概是虽然体力不多，\n却抱持着舍身觉悟挑战极限的英姿吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_7601_028ari", "source_sha256": "89c1e0f060c054b62aa182267d8410d681ff61d069fec27a7f762d63df1b79fe", "ja": "それ、褒められてるんでしょうか……？\nいや！　その前に、ちょっと待ってください！", "zh": "这是在夸我吗……？\n不对！在那之前，请先等一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_7602_028ari", "source_sha256": "f65056e861d787d4b92f3f1ce1c808151877b9033cf1cf938a9ca59a6ff90be7", "ja": "ありさ一人で、敵を想定して限界まで戦えと？\n……{$P$}さん、敵役やりません？", "zh": "要亚利沙一个人设想出敌人，然后战斗到极限吗？\n……{$P$}先生，要不要来演反派？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
